<title>INDIA: India's CARE assigns a PR1+ rating to Blue Star.</title>
<headline>India's CARE assigns a PR1+ rating to Blue Star.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Analysis &amp; Research Ltd (CARE) said on Thursday it assigned a &quot;PR1+ rating to a 250 million rupees commercial paper programme of airconditioning firm Blue Star Ltd.</p>
<p>During FY'97, the airconditioning and refrigeration division contributed nearly 66 percent to total income of the firm.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
